            "review_title": "Review at Somme Wine Bar",
            "review_text": "Hannah B\n5 contributions\n0\nPerfect for a slow dinner in Saigon\nSep 2026 • Friends\nCame here for dinner with friends and ended up staying much longer than planned. The rooftop has a really nice vibe — lots of greenery, warm lighting, and it feels tucked away from the usual Saigon noise.\n\nThe food was a pleasant surprise too. We ordered a bunch of dishes to share and everything was genuinely good, not just “good for a wine bar.” It’s definitely somewhere you can come for a proper dinner, have a few glasses of wine, and settle in for the evening.\n\nReally nice spot for a date, dinner with friends, or when you want somewhere a bit more relaxed and less hectic.\nRead more\nWritten September 28, 2026",
